<title>SPAIN: Reuters second ex-Madrid air cargo market report.</title>
<headline>Reuters second ex-Madrid air cargo market report.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Below are the current average ex-Madrid Spanish peseta air cargo rates per kg for a 100 kg shipment with a volume to weight ratio of six to one.</p>
<p>				     Sept 16		Aug 12</p>
<p>				   NORTH AMERICA</p>
<p>MAD-JFK				  150		 130</p>
<p>MAD-CHI				  160		 130</p>
<p>MAD-LAX				  180		 140</p>
<p>MAD-MIA				  150		 130</p>
<p>				     LATIN AMERICA</p>
<p>MAD-MEX				  275		  250</p>
<p>MAD-BAI				  400		  350</p>
<p>MAD-RIO				  360		  350</p>
<p>					 FAR EAST</p>
<p>MAD-TYO				   325		 300</p>
<p>MAD-HKG				   260		 275</p>
<p>					 AUSTRALIA</p>
<p>MAD-SYD				    485		 n.a.</p>
<p>*The rates quoted in the report were obtained by Reuters journalists on a confidential basis from a range of airlines, general sales agents and freight forwarders based at and near Madrid airport.</p>
<p>--Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 8982 Fax +44 171 542 5017</p>
